# Redundant copy of ../.Rprofile. RStudio's "Run Document" sources whatever
# .Rprofile matches the R session's actual startup working directory, which
# isn't always the project root depending on how the session was opened --
# this covers the case where it's this folder instead. See ../.Rprofile for
# the full explanation of why tutorial.storage needs to be off locally.
options(tutorial.storage = "none")
